  "body": "https://html.spec.whatwg.org/#the-storage-interface uses phrases like \"the number of key/value pairs\" or \"the current value associated with the given _key_\".\r\n\r\nThis is basically exactly what https://infra.spec.whatwg.org/#maps is for. We can rephrase pretty much everything there in terms of Infra, linking to terms as we go. This will help clarity and uniformity.\r\n\r\nThe hardest part of this is defining where the map object is created. This is connected to the \"storage area\" concept? I think the storage area is in fact the map.",
